# Both wasms in this directory are downloaded at run time, version-matched to
# what the run is actually testing, and must never be committed:
#   kv_store.wasm  — from the pinned core release's kv-store-test-fixture.mpk
#                    (.github/workflows/merobox-sync.yml)
#   curb-app.wasm  — from the app registry
#                    (.github/workflows/merobox-chat-sync.yml)
# A committed copy is a copy that goes stale silently: the vendored kv_store.wasm
# drifted 10 release candidates behind the node, and a wasm that predates the
# node's host ABI leaves the joining node on the all-ones "uninitialized" hash
# forever — which reads as a cross-node sync bug.
*.wasm
